OL,3,GNEWSAWord wizard doctor is nation's
OL,4,Abest scrabble player
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Scrabble Champion. The words
OL,7,Ftogether would earn a combined total of
OL,8,Fat least 39 points if placed down on a
OL,9,Fboard, but for one Oxfordshire doctor
OL,10,Fthe title is more than just a game,
OL,11,Fit's his reality.
OL,13,FBy day Harshan Lamabadusuriya is a
OL,14,Fpaediatrician, but in his spare time he
OL,15,Fhas now been crowned the UK's best
OL,16,Fscrabble player three times.
OL,18,FThe 46-year-old, from Abingdon, claimed
OL,19,Fhis third title over the weekend -
OL,20,Fbeating out 67 other players at this
OL,21,Fyear's National Scrabble Championships
OL,22,Fin Milton Keynes.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
