OL,3,GNEWSAWord wizard doctor is nation's
OL,4,Abest scrabble player
OL,5,
OL,6,FHaving won his first title in 2003, he
OL,7,Fwaited another 22 years to earn his
OL,8,Fsecond win at last year's championship
OL,9,F- before going back-to-back.
